[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0600","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57801","title":"Linux Kernel mlx5e 驱动 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 net/mlx5e 驱动在卸载 vport representor 时存在释放后使用漏洞。驱动卸载过程中，unregister_netdev 在 vport rep 卸载后调用，导致 mlx5e_rep_priv 已被释放，但代码仍尝试访问 rpriv->netdev 或遍历 rpriv->tc_ht，触发 UAF。攻击者需本地低权限访问，通过触发驱动卸载/重载流程利用 UAF 实现提权，影响搭载 Mellanox 网卡的 Linux 内核，CVSS 7.8 高危。Linux 内核已通过增加 loaded 标志检查修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57801"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.70、6.11.9、6.12.2 或更高版本（包含修复补丁 commit 8f8a5b3e8f7a）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请执行 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-generic` 安装 USN-7381-1/USN-7514-1 提供的内核更新（版本 ≥ 6.8.0-52.52 或 6.11.0-14.14）。如暂时无法重启内核，可通过 `echo 0 > /sys/module/mlx5_core/parameters/prof_sel` 禁用 mlx5e TC 规则卸载功能作为临时缓解，但需重启网卡驱动生效。建议优先通过发行版官方渠道（如 `apt upgrade linux-generic`、`yum update kernel`、`dnf update kernel`）应用官方内核补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e45dd1622a2c1a83c11bf42fdd8c1810123d6c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47c78d3fc26e38ab805613a0f592dc8a820c7c64","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a03b368562a7ff5f5f1f63b5adf8309cbdbd5be","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57801.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57801.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57801.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57801.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57801","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57801.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57801.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57801-netmlx5e-skip-restore-tc-rules-for--1771409919000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-7q6q-ppp8-9gr5/GHSA-7q6q-ppp8-9gr5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57801"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0598","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57795","title":"Linux Kernel RDMA/rxe 模块 net_device 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDMA/rxe（Soft RoCE）驱动中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该驱动维护了对 net_device 的直接指针引用，当网络设备被删除释放后，已排队等待处理的工作队列事件 ib_cache_event_task 仍会访问已释放的 net_device，触发 slab 释放后内存访问，导致系统崩溃或潜在的信息泄露。本地攻击者只需低权限即可通过构造特定的网络设备生命周期操作序列触发此漏洞，实现权限提升或系统拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57795"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:03Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12 及以上版本，该版本包含修复 RXE 驱动 use-after-free 的补丁。对于 Ubuntu 用户，运行 sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade 安装安全更新（Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 对应 linux-image 6.8.0-2042-raspi-realtime 及更高版本）。若无法立即升级内核，可在不需要 RDMA 功能的系统中禁用 rxe 模块（执行 sudo modprobe -r rxe 或在 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 blacklist rxe），消除攻击面。重启系统使更改生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ac5415022d16d63d912a39a06f32f1f51140261","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32ca3557d968e662957131374a5f81c9c9cdbba8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9f6f54e6a6863131442b40e14d1792b090c7ce21","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57795.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57795","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57795.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57795.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57795.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-57795.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-3h9j-8c2j-4jrj/GHSA-3h9j-8c2j-4jrj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57795","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-59091.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/usn/8204-1.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0502","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-36476","title":"Linux Kernel RDMA/rtrs 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDMA/rtrs 子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞，由于 `ib_sge list` 变量被错误地声明在 `always_invalidate` 代码块内部，导致其作用域受限，后续操作中访问该变量时触发内核空指针解引用，造成系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。本地攻击者可通过触发 RDMA 操作利用此漏洞，影响使用 RDMA/rxe 驱动的 Linux 内核版本。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-36476"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T07:36:48Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.13 及以上版本，或更新至对应长期支持分支：5.10.233+、5.15.176+、6.1.124+、6.6.70+、6.12.9+。Debian 用户安装 2025 年 3 月安全更新。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 RDMA rtrs 模块（blacklist rtrs_client 和 rtrs_server）临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/143378075904e78b3b2a810099bcc3b3d82d762f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32e1e748a85bd52b20b3857d80fd166d22fa455a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ffb5c1885195ae5211a12b4acd2d51843ca41b0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7eaa71f56a6f7ab87957213472dc6d4055862722","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b238f61cc394d5fef27b26d7d9aa383ebfddabb0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb514b31395946022f13a08e06a435f53cf9e8b3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-36476.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36476.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-36476","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-36476.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2024/36xxx/CVE-2024-36476.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-36476.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/891e02cb95ef463730509df70a6ab47638098a75/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-36476-2025-11-03-1432","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-36476.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-jhgr-2wpg-7p64/GHSA-jhgr-2wpg-7p64.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-36476"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0502.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0552","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-53263","title":"Git LFS Git LFS 凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Git LFS 在向 Git 凭据助手请求远程主机凭据时，未对 URL 中嵌入的换行控制字符（如 LF、CR）进行过滤，直接将包含控制字符的 URL 传递给 `git-credential` 命令，导致凭据助手返回的凭据被发送回攻击者控制的远程主机。攻击者可构造包含 URL 编码控制字符的恶意 HTTP URL，诱导用户克隆或拉取恶意仓库，窃取用户的 Git 凭据（如 GitHub Token、个人访问令牌等）。该漏洞影响 Git LFS v3.6.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 4.0 评分 8.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、需要用户交互。Git LFS v3.6.1 已修复该漏洞，用户应尽快升级至 v3.6.1 或更高版本，目前暂无已知缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-53263"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T20:15:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:08:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Git LFS 至 v3.6.1 或更高版本（https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/releases/tag/v3.6.1），执行 `git lfs install --force` 完成更新。官方确认暂无有效缓解措施，无法升级时应避免克隆或拉取不受信的远程仓库，并定期轮换 Git 凭据（如 GitHub Token、个人访问令牌）以降低泄露影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/commit/0345b6f816e611d050c0df67b61f0022916a1c90","https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/releases/tag/v3.6.1","https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/security/advisories/GHSA-q6r2-x2cc-vrp7","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00022.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-53263.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53263.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-53263.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-53263","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/CVE-2024-53263.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53263.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/44cc6e647bc72eb00252fdc038d1b752985e6630/references/contrib1-CVE-2024-53263-2025-01-23-1705","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2025-3390.yaml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-53263.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0552.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0547","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0547.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52006","title":"Git Git凭证助手换行混淆致凭证泄露漏洞","description":"Git 凭证助手使用基于行的协议交换凭证信息，部分生态系统（如 .NET 和 Node.js）将单个回车符（CR）视为换行符，导致针对 CVE-2020-5260 的防护措施对这类凭证助手失效。攻击者可诱导用户克隆包含恶意回车符的非受信 URL（尤其是递归克隆），利用凭证助手将回车符视为换行的特性，绕过协议解析保护并窃取凭证。该漏洞影响 Git v2.48.1、v2.47.2、v2.46.3、v2.45.3、v2.44.3、v2.43.6、v2.42.4、v2.41.3、v2.40.4 之前的版本，CVSS 4.0 评分 2.1（LOW），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、需要用户交互。Git 官方已在提交 b01b9b8 中修复，建议用户升级至修复版本或避免从非受信 URL 克隆仓库。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52006"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T19:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:06:47Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Git 到以下任一修复版本：v2.48.1、v2.47.2、v2.46.3、v2.45.3、v2.44.3、v2.43.6、v2.42.4、v2.41.3 或 v2.40.4。如暂时无法升级，请避免从不可信 URL 克隆仓库，特别是禁用递归克隆（git clone --recursive），并检查凭证助手配置是否使用受影响的 .NET 或 node.js 生态工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/security/advisories/GHSA-86c2-4x57-wc8g","https://github.com/git/git/commit/b01b9b81d36759cdcd07305e78765199e1bc2060","https://github.com/git/git/security/advisories/GHSA-qm7j-c969-7j4q","https://github.com/git/git/security/advisories/GHSA-r5ph-xg7q-xfrp","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00025.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52006.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52006.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-02/Git%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E5%BC%8F%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%87%AD%E6%8D%AE%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9ECVE-2024-50349%20CVE-2024-52006.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-52006","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-52006.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52006.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/5860bbf473634350fd38caf9df5cf84624b46d52/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-devtools/git/git_2.55.0.bb","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/325d4883b5fe156c18fd47e477e38a13d3899546/README_202502.md","https://github.com/gitbutlerapp/grit/blob/dfb079967b9cbc99e533c21e65f674bb3f5e8b07/git/Documentation/RelNotes/2.41.3.adoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0547.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0542","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50349","title":"Git 交互式凭证提示 URL 清理不当漏洞","description":"Git 在通过终端交互式提示用户输入凭证时，未对 URL 中的特殊字符进行清理。攻击者可以构造包含 ANSI 转义序列的恶意 URL，当用户使用 Git 克隆或访问该 URL 时，终端会解析这些转义序列，从而在界面上伪造出可信 Git 托管站点的身份验证提示，诱骗用户输入用户名和密码。实际上这些凭证会被发送到攻击者控制的不可信站点，导致凭证泄露。该漏洞影响 Git 2.40.4 之前及 2.41.3/2.42.4/2.43.6/2.44.3/2.45.3/2.46.3/2.47.2/2.48.1 之前版本，攻击条件要求用户交互（如克隆恶意仓库），CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。官方已在 v2.48.1 等版本中修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50349"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T19:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Git 至 v2.48.1、v2.47.2、v2.46.3、v2.45.3、v2.44.3、v2.43.6、v2.42.4、v2.41.3 或 v2.40.4 及以上版本，这些版本已包含提交 7725b81 和 c903985 的补丁。如无法立即升级，应避免从不可信 URL 克隆仓库，尤其禁止递归克隆操作，并建议使用凭据助手（credential helper）替代终端交互式输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/git/git/commit/7725b8100ffbbff2750ee4d61a0fcc1f53a086e8","https://github.com/git/git/commit/c903985bf7e772e2d08275c1a95c8a55ab011577","https://github.com/git/git/security/advisories/GHSA-hmg8-h7qf-7cxr","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00025.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50349.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50349.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-50349","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-50349.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50349.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/BUseclab/cve-genie/blob/71ca21d77aedec9528b8df1c6b014714cdc70067/results/reproduced_cves/CVE-2024-50349/scripts/exploit.py","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/5860bbf473634350fd38caf9df5cf84624b46d52/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-devtools/git/git_2.55.0.bb","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-02/Git%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E5%BC%8F%E5%87%AD%E8%AF%81%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%87%AD%E6%8D%AE%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9ECVE-2024-50349%20CVE-2024-52006.md","https://github.com/gitbutlerapp/grit/blob/dfb079967b9cbc99e533c21e65f674bb3f5e8b07/git/Documentation/RelNotes/2.43.6.adoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0541","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-50338","title":"Git Git Credential Manager 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Git Credential Manager (GCM) 存在换行符处理不一致导致的信息泄露漏洞。Git 在解析 credential 协议时仅将 LF（\\n）和 CRLF（\\r\\n）视为换行符，而 .NET StreamReader 的 ReadLineAsync 方法还将单独的 CR（\\r）视为有效换行符。攻击者可构造包含 CR 的恶意远程仓库 URL，当用户克隆或通过 --recursive 参数克隆包含子模块的恶意仓库时，利用该解析差异绕过 Git 的换行符校验，将用户凭据泄露至攻击者控制的另一 Git 远程服务器。该漏洞影响 GCM 2.6.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.4，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-50338"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T19:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:04:15Z","remediation":"立即将 Git Credential Manager (GCM) 升级至 2.6.1 或更高版本，可从 https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/releases/tag/v2.6.1 获取。如无法立即升级，避免使用 `git clone --recursive` 克隆不可信仓库，并在克隆前手动检查子模块的远程 URL 是否可信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git-scm.com/docs/git-credential#IOFMT","https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/e476b43b5cb42eb44ce23b1c7b793aa361624cf6/src/libraries/System.Private.CoreLib/src/System/IO/StreamReader.cs#L926","https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/blob/ae009e11a0fbef804ad9f78816d84a0bc7e052fe/src/shared/Core/StreamExtensions.cs#L138-L141","https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/compare/749e287571c78a2b61f926ccce6a707050871ab8...99e2f7f60e7364fe807e7925f361a81f3c47bd1b","https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/releases/tag/v2.6.1","https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager/security/advisories/GHSA-86c2-4x57-wc8g","https://github.com/git/git/blob/6a11438f43469f3815f2f0fc997bd45792ff04c0/credential.c#L311","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.io.streamreader?view=net-8.0","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-50338.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50338.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/git-credential-manager/CVE-2024-50338.yml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-50338","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/50xxx/CVE-2024-50338.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-50338.html","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-50338.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/01/GHSA-86c2-4x57-wc8g/GHSA-86c2-4x57-wc8g.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-50338"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0482","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12747","title":"Rsync 符号链接处理条件竞争漏洞","description":"Rsync 在处理符号链接时存在条件竞争漏洞（CWE-362）。攻击者可利用 rsync 默认跳过符号链接的行为，在文件被访问前将普通文件替换为符号链接，从而绕过默认限制遍历目标符号链接。根据 rsync 进程权限，攻击者可泄露敏感信息，进而可能导致权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12747"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:25Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:48Z","remediation":"将 rsync 升级至 3.4.1 或更高版本。RHEL 8 用户安装 rsync-3.1.3-21.el8_10，RHEL 9 用户安装 rsync-3.2.5-3.el9，均通过 RHSA-2025:2600 和 RHSA-2025:7050 更新。Debian 用户参照 DLA-2025-01-08 更新。临时缓解措施：避免以 root 权限在不可信目录上运行 rsync，或使用 --no-implied-dirs 参数限制符号链接遍历。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:2600","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:7050","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:8385","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12747","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2332968","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00008.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12747.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12747.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12747.json","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/blob/3b84610ccb35d1355f6e88e0e870bef48a164fbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12747","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2024/12xxx/CVE-2024-12747.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/e804374278d178cbcb1dcf921b09ff120cb635c2/main/rsync/APKBUILD","https:/