thub.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2025-01/%E3%80%90%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A%E3%80%91Rsync%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E4%B8%8E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2024-12084%E2%88%95CVE-2024-12085%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-12085","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/70a2e67cf4b780574379fe6685466348a1f2340b/2024/CVE-2024-12085.json","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/blob/3b84610ccb35d1355f6e88e0e870bef48a164fbb/NEWS.md","https://github.com/Otsutez/cve-2024-12085"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0706","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-7344","title":"Howyar UEFI Reloader 安全启动绕过漏洞","description":"Howyar 的 UEFI 应用程序 \"Reloader\"（32位和64位版本）存在安全功能绕过漏洞，其硬编码路径允许加载并执行未经数字签名的软件。本地攻击者利用管理员权限可将未签名的恶意 UEFI 应用放入该固定路径，从而绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动机制，在系统启动早期阶段执行任意未授权代码，完全破坏平台的可信启动链。该漏洞影响使用 Howyar Reloader 的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2024-7344"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T14:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:19:54Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（包含 KB5049981），该更新已将存在漏洞的 reloader.efi（哈希值 cdb7c90d3ab8833d5324f5d8516d41fa990b9ca721fe643fffaef9057d9f9e48 和 e9e4b5a51f6a5575b9f5bfab1852b0cb2795c66ff4b28135097cba671a5491b9）加入 UEFI 吊销列表（dbx）。同时将 Howyar SysReturn 升级至 10.2.023_20240919 及以上版本，Greenware GreenGuard 升级至 10.2.023-20240927 及以上版本，Radix SmartRecovery 升级至 11.2.023-20240927 及以上版本，Sanfong EZ-back System 升级至 10.3.024-20241127 及以上版本，WASAY eRecoveryRX 升级至 8.4.022-20241127 及以上版本，CES NeoImpact 升级至 10.1.024-20241127 及以上版本，SignalComputer HDD King 升级至 10.3.021-20241127 及以上版本。在 Windows 上以管理员权限运行 PowerShell 命令 `[System.Text.Encoding]::ASCII.GetString((Get-SecureBootUEFI db).bytes) -match 'Microsoft Corporation UEFI CA 2011'` 检查是否受影响，以及 `[BitConverter]::ToString((Get-SecureBootUEFI dbx).bytes) -replace '-' -match 'cdb7c90d3ab8833d5324f5d8516d41fa990b9ca721fe643fffaef9057d9f9e48'` 检查保护是否生效。在 Linux 上使用 `dbxtool --list | grep 'cdb7c90d3ab8833d5324f5d8516d41fa990b9ca721fe643fffaef9057d9f9e48'` 确认吊销已应用。作为临时缓解措施，限制对 EFI 系统分区（ESP）的写入权限，仅允许管理员访问，并启用安全产品对 ESP 文件修改的监控告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://uefi.org/revocationlistfile","https://uefi.org/specs/UEFI/2.10/03_Boot_Manager.html","https://uefi.org/specs/UEFI/2.10/32_Secure_Boot_and_Driver_Signing.html","https://www.eset.com/blog/enterprise/preparing-for-uefi-bootkits-eset-discovery-shows-the-importance-of-cyber-intelligence/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/529659","https://www.welivesecurity.com/en/eset-research/under-cloak-uefi-secure-boot-introducing-cve-2024-7344/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-7344.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7344.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/7xxx/CVE-2024-7344.json","https://github.com/notthehiddenwiki/NTHW/blob/1daa55e411647eccacbb3a5b8723b51f1f08f45e/Z3S%20Links/2025/Jan_2025.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-7344","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/bc76bf461beecebb7c648559b93e442ec7025acb/archive/2025/2025-09-13.md","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/5065dafd85905000b1059d7edda6091ac1b72962/Intel%20Reports/www_welivesecurity_com/en_eset-research_under-cloak-uefi-secure-boot-introducing-cve-2024-7344/link.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2024-7344-2025-01-14-1405","https://github.com/hackyboiz/hackyboiz.github.io/blob/0a88fd44ac6815b13d0cfcb9d086433fd2b6265f/2025/05/21/newp1ayer48/CVE-2024-7344/index.html","https://github.com/splunk/security_content/blob/24d7259ca189e9a7ed547ffa330bbcabf51852fa/detections/endpoint/windows_suspicious_file_in_efi_volume.yml","https://github.com/mkmk435/DanilaBagroot"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0614","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57876","title":"Linux kernel DRM DP MST 竞态条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM DP MST（DisplayPort 多流传输）驱动中存在竞态条件漏洞。当 MST 拓扑在接收下行回复或上行请求边带消息过程中被移除时，`drm_dp_mst_topology_mgr` 的 `up_req_recv/down_rep_recv` 状态可能在一个线程中通过 `drm_dp_mst_set_mst(false)` 被重置，同时另一线程正在通过 `drm_dp_mst_handle_down_rep()` 或 `drm_dp_mst_handle_up_req()` 读取/解析消息，且读取/解析过程未持有锁保护接收状态，导致内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可利用此竞态条件触发内存破坏，可能导致系统崩溃或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57876"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：6.1.120、6.6.66、6.12.5 或更高版本。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt install linux-image-$(uname -r | sed 's/.*/generic/')` 安装 USN-7381-1 或 USN-7450-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级内核，可在 BIOS/引导参数中禁用 DisplayPort MST 功能（添加 `drm.dp_mst=0` 到内核引导参数）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/94b33b2d7640e807869451384eb88321dd0ffbd4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a6fa67d26de385c3c7a23c1e109a0e23bfda4ec7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/be826b4451fd187a7c0b04be4f8243d5df6e0450","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d834d20d2e86c52ed5cab41763fa61e6071680ef","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57876.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57876.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57876","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57876.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57876-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57876.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57876.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-3gjf-8gc5-3w3x/GHSA-3gjf-8gc5-3w3x.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0614.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0613","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57875","title":"Linux Linux内核块层常规区域位图使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核块设备子系统中存在使用后释放（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当磁盘进行重验证（revalidation）操作更新 conventional zones 位图时，`disk_zone_is_conv()` 辅助函数在并发访问中可能引用已释放的内存，导致内核崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用分区块设备（zoned block devices）的 Linux 系统，本地攻击者需具备低权限访问，通过触发磁盘重验证操作即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57875"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-11T15:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:07Z","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.73、6.1.125、5.15.176 或 5.10.232 及以上版本（含修复提交 493326c4f10c）。若无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 SCSI 设备的区域重新验证功能（echo 0 > /sys/block/sdX/queue/zoned）作为临时缓解，或限制本地非特权用户对块设备的访问权限。建议优先通过发行版内核更新（如 Ubuntu USN-7381-1）部署修复内核包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/493326c4f10cc71a42c27fdc97ce112182ee4cbc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7cb6d7414ea1b33536fa6d11805cb8dceec1f97","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57875.yaml","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2024-57875.md","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57875","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57875.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57875-block-rcu-protect-disk-conv-zones-b-1767883741000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57875.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-xr89-c9w4-g997/GHSA-xr89-c9w4-g997.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57875"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0613.toml"}]